    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3553190/extras/8c9ff27ec5ef308f6fa360ad74f056ef.poster.avif?t=1753947944\" width=610 height=184 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3553190/extras/8c9ff27ec5ef308f6fa360ad74f056ef.webm?t=1753947944\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3553190/extras/8c9ff27ec5ef308f6fa360ad74f056ef.mp4?t=1753947944\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Enter the world of Arcadia, where a candy-colored, manga-inspired reality collides with the dark power of portals unleashed by the rising might of the Demon Lord</strong>. Step into the shoes of an ordinary FPS gamer, accidentally summoned to another world to save an adorable realm full of cute creatures\u2026 now twisted by the darkness!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Upgrade your arsenal, fuse monstrous cores with your weapons, increase your rank, and battle increasingly powerful demons.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3553190/extras/d8916588eac131b2e5f33dee3877e984.poster.avif?t=1753947944\" width=610 height=184 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3553190/extras/d8916588eac131b2e5f33dee3877e984.webm?t=1753947944\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3553190/extras/d8916588eac131b2e5f33dee3877e984.mp4?t=1753947944\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From waves of cute yet grotesque monsters and battles against the demon army's officers to a showdown with the Demon Lord himself-get ready for fast-paced, anime-style action!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Win the favor of the Goddesses (each with her own quirky personality), earn divine blessings, uncover the secrets of the celestial pantheon, and prove that even a regular gamer can become the savior of another world.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3553190/extras/154970985615d5f97b41bb344720f64a.poster.avif?t=1753947944\" width=610 height=184 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3553190/extras/154970985615d5f97b41bb344720f64a.webm?t=1753947944\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3553190/extras/154970985615d5f97b41bb344720f64a.mp4?t=1753947944\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > With humor, fast-paced FPS combat, and a touch of divine chaos\u2014this is an adventure you won\u2019t forget!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Right from the start, you receive a divine gift, <strong>a hero\u2019s special ability\u2026</strong> <strong>You can shop online!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3553190/extras/8c9ff27ec5ef308f6fa360ad74f056ef.poster.avif?t=1753947944\" width=610 height=184 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3553190/extras/8c9ff27ec5ef308f6fa360ad74f056ef.webm?t=1753947944\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3553190/extras/8c9ff27ec5ef308f6fa360ad74f056ef.mp4?t=1753947944\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Enter the world of Arcadia, where a candy-colored, manga-inspired reality collides with the dark power of portals unleashed by the rising might of the Demon Lord</strong>. Step into the shoes of an ordinary FPS gamer, accidentally summoned to another world to save an adorable realm full of cute creatures\u2026 now twisted by the darkness!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Upgrade your arsenal, fuse monstrous cores with your weapons, increase your rank, and battle increasingly powerful demons.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3553190/extras/d8916588eac131b2e5f33dee3877e984.poster.avif?t=1753947944\" width=610 height=184 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3553190/extras/d8916588eac131b2e5f33dee3877e984.webm?t=1753947944\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3553190/extras/d8916588eac131b2e5f33dee3877e984.mp4?t=1753947944\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From waves of cute yet grotesque monsters and battles against the demon army's officers to a showdown with the Demon Lord himself-get ready for fast-paced, anime-style action!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Win the favor of the Goddesses (each with her own quirky personality), earn divine blessings, uncover the secrets of the celestial pantheon, and prove that even a regular gamer can become the savior of another world.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3553190/extras/154970985615d5f97b41bb344720f64a.poster.avif?t=1753947944\" width=610 height=184 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3553190/extras/154970985615d5f97b41bb344720f64a.webm?t=1753947944\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3553190/extras/154970985615d5f97b41bb344720f64a.mp4?t=1753947944\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > With humor, fast-paced FPS combat, and a touch of divine chaos\u2014this is an adventure you won\u2019t forget!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Right from the start, you receive a divine gift, <strong>a hero\u2019s special ability\u2026</strong> <strong>You can shop online!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p>",
    "short_description": "An isekai with anime vibes, hellish bullet storms and fast-paced FPS combat. Imagine being thrown into a world of chaos - bullets flying everywhere, relentless bosses... and death? It's just the beginning in this roguelike action ride.",
